 waiting for the committee.} other {# contact messages are waiting for the committee.}}","committeeBannerLink":"Open the inbox","myMessages":"My messages","myMessagesOpen":"{count, plural, =0 {No open request} one {# open request} other {# open requests}}","pickTitle":"You're writing about…","help":{"join":"Membership is online and takes 3 minutes: fill in the form, then the committee approves it.","joinCta":"Join now","joinQuestion":"I have a question before joining","eventsVisitor":"Watch parties and away trips are for members. A question before you join? Write to us.","eventsMember":"Sign-ups happen directly on each event's page.","eventsMemberCta":"See the events","fees":"The amount, how to pay and the state of your fee are on your fee page.","feesCta":"My fee","account":"You can download all your data or delete your account yourself, in your settings.","accountCta":"My settings","website":"Tell us what you were doing and what happened. The page concerned and your browser are attached to the message.","partnership":"Bar, sponsor, media or another club: tell us about your project, we'll get back to you quickly.","other":"Ask your question, the committee will reply.","accountVisitor":"Access, correction or deletion of your personal data: describe your request, the committee answers within the legal time limits."},"form":{"name":"Name","namePlaceholder":"First Last","email":"Email","emailPlaceholder":"you@example.ch","organisation":"Organisation","organisationPlaceholder":"Bar, company, media…","page":"Page concerned","message":"Message","messagePlaceholder":"Your message…","chars":"{count} / 5000","tooShort":"At least {count, plural, one {# more character} other {# more characters}}.","required":"Required.","invalidEmail":"Invalid email address.","sentAs":"Sent as {name} · {email}","privacy":"Your message is read by the committee and kept for at most 2 years after the conversation ends. <link>Privacy</link>","send":"Send","sending":"Sending…","changeTopic":"Change topic","draftRestored":"Draft restored","errors":{"generic":"The message didn't go through. Your text is kept: try again.","tooFast":"One moment… read your message again, then send it.","tooMany":"Too many messages sent. Try again in an hour.","retry":"Try again"}},"success":{"title":"Message sent","reference":"Reference","steps":{"email":"An acknowledgement is on its way to {email}.","answer":"The committee replies within 24 h.","follow":"Follow the conversation and reply from your personal link."},"stepsMember":{"email":"An acknowledgement is on its way to your address.","answer":"The committee replies within 24 h.","follow":"The reply arrives by email and in \"My messages\"."},"follow":"Follow my request","copyLink":"Copy link","linkCopied":"Link copied","another":"Write another message"},"faqTitle":"Frequently asked questions","faq":[{"q":"How much is membership?","a":"The annual fee is {fee} ({juniorFee} for under-18s). It covers the season, from 1 July to 30 June."},{"q":"Does the club sell tickets for PSG games?","a":"No. Tickets are sold by PSG's official ticket office. The club organises away trips and shares tips with its members."},{"q":"How do watch parties work?","a":"Members sign up online, then show their member card at the door. Dates are in the events calendar."},{"q":"Do I need to be a member for away trips?","a":"Yes: away trips and events are for members whose fee is paid."},{"q":"Who can join?","a":"Any PSG supporter living in or connected to Switzerland. You apply online and the committee approves it."},{"q":"How do I get or delete my data?","a":"From your settings: you can download all your data or delete your account, without going through us."}],"committeeTitle":"The committee","committeeIntro":"Volunteer supporters who read every message.","newReplies":"{count, plural, one {# new reply} other {# new replies}}","followTitle":"Follow us","followBody":"Photos and the atmosphere of our watch parties.","emailBody":"Write to us from your mail app."},"Onboarding":{"pageTitle":"Welcome","welcome":{"title":"Welcome, {name}!","body":"Your address is confirmed. A few questions so the club can get to know you a little better.","bodyPending":"Your address is confirmed and your application is on its way to the committee. Meanwhile, a few questions so the club can get to know you a little better.","duration":"5 questions · 1 minute · all optional"},"start":"Let's go","next":"Next","skip":"Skip","finish":"Finish","backToRecap":"Back to the summary","later":"Later","back":"Previous step","progress":"Step {current} of {total}","saved":"Your profile is saved.","error":"Saving failed. Please try again.","contact":{"title":"Your contact details","why":"So the committee can reach you, especially on trips.","addressPlaceholder":"Street, number, city"},"birth":{"title":"Your date of birth","why":"The statutes distinguish active members (18 and over) from junior members. Other members never see it.","day":"Day","month":"Month","year":"Year","invalid":"Incomplete or invalid date.","junior":"You will be a <b>junior member</b>: reduced fee, and the committee will ask for a legal guardian's consent."},"interests":{"title":"What interests you","why":"So we can suggest the right events.","hint":"Pick as many as you like."},"ticketing":{"title":"PSG tickets","why":"To organise group ticket purchases for trips."},"photos":{"title":"Club photos","why":"The club posts photos of its events on its website and social media. You can change your mind at any time.","yes":"I'm happy to appear in photos","yesHint":"Club website and social media","no":"I'd rather not appear","noHint":"The club will avoid posting photos where you can be recognised"},"recap":{"title":"All set","body":"Here is what you filled in. Everything can be changed in your settings.","birthDate":"Date of birth","interests":"Interests","ticketing":"PSG tickets","photos":"Photos","photosYes":"Happy to appear","photosNo":"Rather not appear","empty":"Not filled in","edit":"Edit"}},"MemberProfile":{"interests":{"watch_party":"Watch parties","home_trips":"Trips to the Parc","away_trips":"Away trips","members_match":"Members' matches","social":"Nights out"},"ticketing":{"season_ticket":{"label":"Parc season-ticket holder","hint":"Season ticket at the Parc des Princes"},"myparis_premium":{"label":"MyParis Premium","hint":"Priority on ticket sales"},"myparis":{"label":"Free MyParis account","hint":"Sale alerts"},"none":{"label":"None","hint":"No PSG ticketing account"}},"junior":"Junior","noPhotos":"No photos","age":"{age} years old"},"Notifications":{"label":"Notifications","labelUnread":"Notifications ({count} unread)","loading":"Loading…","empty":"Nothing new for now.","manage":"Manage notification emails","predictionBody":"PSG – {opponent}: make your call before kick-off.","pointsBody":"{count, plural, =0 {0 points} one {# point} other {# points}} on PSG – {opponent}","membershipBody":"Your membership has been accepted. Welcome to the club!","kinds":{"article":"New article","event":"New event","prediction":"Prediction to make","points":"Your prediction result","membership":"Membership","contactInbox":"Contact messages","contactReply":"Committee's reply"},"contactInboxBody":"{count, plural, one {# message to handle} other {# messages to handle}}","contactReplyBody":"The committee replied to your request {reference}."},"LocaleSwitcher":{"label":"Language","fr":"Français","en":"English","de":"Deutsch"},"ThemeToggle":{"label":"Toggle theme","short":"Theme"},"Banner":{"close":"Hide announcement","learnMore":"Learn more"},"ComingSoon":{"eyebrow":"Under construction","title":"Coming soon","body":"The website of the official Paris Saint-Germain supporters club in Zurich is on its way. In the meantime, get in touch:"},"Login":{"title":"Sign in","body":"Access your member area.","email":"Email address","emailPlaceholder":"first.last@example.ch","password":"Password","forgot":"Forgot password?","submit":"Sign in","submitting":"Signing in…","noAccoun